at doesn't connect with my Dots suit sequence. Keeping B5, B6, B7, B8 gives me the best waiting pattern with multiple potential winning tiles (B5, B8, or B9) to complete either a pair or a chow. This maximizes my chances of winning since these tiles still have copies remaining in the unshown tiles.\n\nAnswer: Play T8"}
